From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 04:48:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: Add Exynos9820

The PMU, the USI and the PERIC0 system register block reuse the register
layout of an already documented SoC, so only the compatible strings are
added.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
